Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: classify the single-pad test generator

The retained TPG registers with an unknown entity function. Classify
this single-source-pad generator as a synthetic camera sensor, as VIMC
does. This removes the registration warning without changing pads,
stream operations or link selection.

---
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-tpg.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-tpg.c
@@ -489,6 +489,7 @@
 
 	tpg->pad.flags = MEDIA_PAD_FL_SOURCE;
 
+	sd->entity.function = MEDIA_ENT_F_CAM_SENSOR;
 	sd->entity.ops = &tpg_media_ops;
 	ret = media_entity_pads_init(&sd->entity, 1, &tpg->pad);
 	if (ret < 0) {
